    "identifier": "fushin-typhoon-release-jettison",
    "description": "<p>You release an explosion of wind protecting you with a burst of air. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +4 Bonus to AC. Creatures who are within the affected area when you cast this jutsu must succeed a Strength saving throw, taking 2d6 wind damage and push to the edge of this jutsu’s area into a space that can hold them on a failure.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the area by 5 feet.</p>",
